comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T20:55:22.187Z",codex-agent,"Observed again during PR #134 closeout: node_modules/.bin/pm health --check-only --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers exits 1 with extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.10.15:2026.10.20:pm-github in the package worktree. Integrity is OK; the extension skew is the only gate-failing finding. Existing stale-item and provenance-domain findings remain advisory. In a disposable checkout, following .github/workflows/ci.yml and installing npm:pm-github@2026.10.4 through the repo-pinned host makes the same strict health command exit 0, with extension health OK and only those two existing storage advisories. The release gates for PR #134 both pass 1752/1752 at 100% in all coverage dimensions. SDK pins, telemetry settings and existing history are unchanged. This receipt enriches the existing follow-up; compatibility remediation remains out of scope for the signature review."
